  "label": "state_WAITING",
  "description": "复刻 tools/fish/states_fishing.go:125-215 handleWaiting. 抛竿后等鱼咬钩 state. 路径: (1) elapsed < 500ms (minIconLatency) → 留 WAITING; (2) hook_text 命中 → hookStreak++; hookStreak >= 2 (hookStreakCount) → 调 try_hook_F → done→FISHING+fishingStart=now+emptyCastStreak=0+controlDir=0 / failed→RECOVERING; (3) hook_text miss → 清 hookStreak; (4) elapsed > 75000ms (baitWarningTimeout) → 调 inspect_phase + GetVar(_inspectPhaseResult) + Switch 路由 8 case (settle_win/settle_fail→IDLE, warehouse_full→SHOPSELL, need_bait→BUYBAIT, setup→SETUP, ready→IDLE, fighting→FISHING+fishingStart=now+emptyCastStreak=0+controlDir=0, default→RECOVERING). 简化: 跳过 hookStreakWindow (production 节奏总满足), StartFish 误入检测, emptyCastStreak Pause/WaitUnpause. 调用方义务: container 顶层声明 fishingStart, emptyCastStreak (number default 0).",
